  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Roll out bao dough to 1/4 inch thickness.",
    "Cut out small squares and place a spoonful of coconut milk mixture in the center of each square.",
    "Fold bao into triangles and press edges to seal.",
    "Brush tops with melted butter and beaten egg for a golden glaze.",
    "Bake in preheated oven for 12-15 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Dust with granulated sugar and garnish with shredded coconut.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
